# Wave W15-T4 (Revelry TV tower): revtvcap-r — the east shoulder pylon of the Revelry TV tower, 16x48, bottom-anchored on the station's existing roof row (Premium+ W6 TX-3). Mirror of revtvcap-l: gold-tipped needle, crossarm, stepped shoulder, glass-band shaft in beamroof's register; worn only at the roof run's east end (x=18). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-W15-LANDMARKS-PLAN.md §1.7/§2.)
